Hello there!

Our publisher, Movie Games, has the pleasure to announce a new game from the producers behind Drug Dealer Simulator. Say hi to a first-person simulator game with RPG elements inspired by Thief and Shawshank Redemption, Prison King!

[previewyoutube=KO8GlZS38Bs;full][/previewyoutube]

Sentenced for innocence… And now you need to learn how to survive. Navigate the prison life, make deals with guards and gangs alike, manage and sell contraband, and plot your next move. Your goal: to get out.

Features:
Manage and sell contraband to other prisoners;
Make deals with both prison gangs and guards;
Collect valuable intel;
Customise your prison cell;
Collect proof of your innocence or plot a daring prison break and unlock different endings.

Deal your way out of prison! Wishlist Prison King now ⬇

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1897030/Prison_King/

Hello there!

Our friends over at Movie Games and Brave Lamb Studio have the pleasure to announce Enemy of the State, a top-down action shooter game revealed during the Future Games Show! It’s a brand new game from the creators of War Hospital.

Enemy of the State is a co-op and single-player shooter set in the world of 1920s crime lords. You play as an aspiring gangster trying to reach the top during the Prohibition era. Your task is to build the most powerful crime syndicate in the world!

Take a look at our trailer:

[previewyoutube=YMz75VSYBg0;full][/previewyoutube]

What can you expect in the game?
Single-player mode or a 3-person co-op;
A variety of available missions;
Character customisation, including choosing the ethnicity of your character;
Combat with customizable weapons and a cover system;
Extensive player progression with many available classes;
Player-created syndicates competing with each other online;
Interactive, customizable hub.

Interested? Wishlist the game here:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2012040/Enemy_of_the_State/

All wishlists are greatly appreciated!
